# Father Figure (bastok 29): Michea in Bastok Markets, beside The Elvaan Goldsmith (C#). The guard (The Elvaan Goldsmith
# completed and Bastok fame level 2), the silver ingot trade, no repeat.
lists BastokMarkets/Michea/onTrigger BastokMarkets/Michea/onTrade BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/215 BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/240 BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/241
char zone=BastokMarkets pos=-296,-16,-157
item SilverIngot x2
item CopperIngot
fame Bastok 50                  # fame level 2
quest Bastok.TheElvaanGoldsmith accepted
login
trigger Michea                  # The Elvaan Goldsmith not completed: its reminder 215, not 240
finish
quest Bastok.TheElvaanGoldsmith completed
fame Bastok 49                  # fame level 1
trigger Michea                  # fame level 1: The Elvaan Goldsmith's repeat 215, not 240
finish
fame Bastok 50                  # fame level 2
trigger Michea                  # the offer, 240
finish                          # accepted
trigger Michea                  # accepted: Michea's default 125
finish
trade Michea CopperIngot x1     # the wrong ingot: nothing
trade Michea SilverIngot x1     # 241
finish                          # completed: 2200 gil, fame 20, an ingot gone
trigger Michea                  # completed: 125
finish
trade Michea SilverIngot x1     # completed: nothing
